        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Fusion 16-Z2, Elite Collection Victorian Clear Glass Knob with Cambridge Rose</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Clear Glass Elite Knobset made by Fusion Hardware is beautiful. It is so gorgeous how the light is reflected among the facets of the glass knob. This Victorian Clear Glass Knob with Cambridge Rose is easy to install since it will fit 1-3/8 inch to 2 inch thick doors and has an adjustable backset for either 2-3/8 inches or 2-3/4 inches. Choose from 5 finishes for the Cambridge Rosette.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Fusion 16 Z2 Clear Glass Knob with Cambridge Rose:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Solid Brass/Bronze Construction</li>\r\n<li>Cycle Tested to ANSI Standards</li>\r\n<li>Exclusive Fusion knob spring assembly for lifetime performance.</li>\r\n<li>Reversible Latchbolt in matching/coordinating finish.</li>\r\n<li>Easy assembly with alignment block and rose posts.</li>\r\n<li>Concealed screw rose cover.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the Victorian Glass Knob With Cambridge Rosette:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Knob Diameter: 2-3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Knob Projection: 2-3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Rose Diameter: 2-5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: adjustable for 1-3/8\" to 2\"</li>\r\n<li>Backset: adjustable for 2-3/8\" to 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Knob Material: Glass</li>\r\n<li>Standard Latch Rotation is 40 Degrees.</li>\r\n<li>Square corner latches and strike plates.</li>\r\n<li>Lifetime Limited Warranty on workmanship, materials, and operation.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>When Selecting a Function:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Single Dummy:</b> Non-functional pull to match trim on one side of the door. Just for looks, it does not latch and does not lock.</li>\r\n<li><b>Dummy Set:</b> Non-functional pull to match trim on both sides of the door. Just for looks, it does not latch and does not lock.</li>\r\n<li><b>Passage (Hall or Closet):</b> For doors that don't need locking.</li>\r\n<li><b>Privacy (Bedroom or Bathroom):</b> For doors that could need locking.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Clear Glass Elite Knobset, Fusion 16-Z2",
                "description": "Fusion 16-Z2, Clear Glass Elite Knobset - The Clear Glass Elite Knobset made by Fusion Hardware is beautiful. It is so gorgeous how the light is reflected among the facets of the glass knob. This Victorian Clear Glass Knob with Cambridge Rose is easy to install since it will fit 1-3/8 inch to 2 inch thick doors and has an adjustable backset for either 2-3/8 inches or 2-3/4 inches. Choose from 5 finishes for the Cambridge Rosette.\r\n",
